    "project": "research/local_translation_audit_20261115/lean",
    "theorem": "LocalTranslationAudit.actual_local_translation_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem actual_local_translation_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] [IsAlgClosed K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (hΔ : W.Δ≠0), (∀ (P Q : W.Point) (f : W.FunctionField), localFunctionValuation W P (fieldTranslation W hΔ Q f)=localFunctionValuation W (P+Q) f) ∧ (∀ (P Q : W.Point) (f : W.FunctionField), pointOrder W (fieldTranslation W hΔ Q f) P=pointOrder W f (P+Q)) ∧ (∀ (P Q : W.Point) (r : RegularRing W (P+Q)), (regularTranslationEquiv W hΔ P Q r : W.FunctionField)=fieldTranslation W hΔ Q r) ∧ (∀ (P Q : W.Point) (r : RegularRing W P), ((regularTranslationEquiv W hΔ P Q).symm r : W.FunctionField)=fieldTranslation W hΔ (-Q) r) ∧ (∀ (P Q : W.Point) (r : RegularRing W (P+Q)), regularEvaluation W P (regularTranslation W hΔ P Q r)=regularEvaluation W (P+Q) r) ∧ (∀ (Q : W.Point) (f : W.FunctionField) (hf : f≠0), functionDivisor W (fieldTranslation W hΔ Q f) (translation_nonzero W hΔ Q hf)= divisorTranslation W (-Q) (functionDivisor W f hf)) ∧ (∀ (Q : W.Point) (D : W.Point →₀ ℤ) (f : W.FunctionFieldˣ), Disjoint D.support (functionDivisor W (translatedUnit W hΔ Q f) (translatedUnit W hΔ Q f).ne_zero).support ↔ Disjoint (divisorTranslation W Q D).support (functionDivisor W f f.ne_zero).support) ∧ (∀ (Q : W.Point) (D : W.Point →₀ ℤ) (f : W.FunctionFieldˣ) (hd : Disjoint (divisorTranslation W Q D).support (functionDivisor W f f.ne_zero).support), evaluateDivisor W D (translatedUnit W hΔ Q f) ((translation_disjoint_support W hΔ Q D f).mpr hd)= evaluateDivisor W (divisorTranslation W Q D) f hd)) ∧ CharP SignClosure 5 ∧ signCurve.Δ≠0 ∧ signPoint≠0 ∧ (3 : ℕ) • signPoint=0 ∧ signPoint≠-signPoint ∧ signFunction≠0 ∧ pointOrder signCurve signFunction signPoint=3 ∧ pointOrder signCurve signFunction (-signPoint)=0 ∧ pointOrder signCurve (fieldTranslation signCurve sign_delta signPoint signFunction) 0=3 ∧ functionDivisor signCurve (fieldTranslation signCurve sign_delta signPoint signFunction) (translation_nonzero signCurve sign_delta signPoint sign_function_nonzero)≠ divisorTranslation signCurve signPoint (functionDivisor signCurve signFunction sign_function_nonzero)",
    "decl_sha256": "77d0bb9d6c1b5941dec62869d0023c6bb2917322004d870fc762d26ffcc50dc0",
    "scope": "Actual elliptic translation pullback compatibility on every nonsingular general Weierstrass model over an algebraically closed coefficient field, every characteristic including 2/3. Actual shifted curve relation and actual generic translation formulas derive coordinate differences, infinity cancellation, strict maximal-ideal bounds and exact translated actual point-uniformizer value exp(-1), using actual nonsingularity in the zero-y-derivative branch. Actual coordinate substitution into actual infinity regular ring and actual residue diagram prove actual localization denominator units; actual point-local localization map commutes with full-field translation and residue. Actual unit value and official actual DVR uniformizer-times-unit factorization derive infinity normalized valuation equality on every full-field function. Previously proved actual field composition derives all-point normalized valuation/order compatibility, including every exceptional point. Actual regular-ring RingEquiv/bijectivity/explicit negative-point inverse and actual residue naturality derived, not premises. Actual principal divisor of field pullback Q equals actual point pushforward negative Q. Actual local-unit character transport, actual support-disjointness iff and actual guarded divisor evaluation transport derived. Product helper outside-unit default is not claimed to be a meromorphic residue. Actual ACF5/CharP5/nonsingular scalar extension of credited F5 curve y²=x³+1, actual nonzero order-three point P distinct from negative P, actual nonzero tangent with divisor3P-3O: actual order P=3,negative P=0,pullback at infinity=3, disproving positive-Q divisor pushforward identity. Known source methods/finite control credited, no qualified source refutation/new population/novelty. Nine new concrete modules/96 frozen modules/zero copies/105 old formal files/all124 old pins checked before-after21 states and gate. Fourteen failed states/seven successes retained; early latest-only Lake roots could reuse old oleans, corrected17 with complete-root actual rebuild; automatic exact root coverage from18, full nine-root final21 and whole source gate required. Default200000-heartbeat failures from missing evaluation imports retained; fixed imports/concrete regular-ring domains/transparent actual field-ring interfaces, no limits or global flags. Fresh Galbraith correctedch7 PDF10-11 printed132-133 fulltext and individual visual (Lemmas7.4.7/7.4.10-14/7.4.16; beginning7.5.1 only); rereadch9 PDF3-4 text with previous visuals credited and explicit Q/O exclusions. Copyright local only; official DVR/adic and prior actual point-local, residue and FF translation proofs credited. Four correct KB calls and Conductor127 before approach/code, bounded fallback/no absence claim. Separate Scheme.localRing/line-bundle comparison, general base-field descent, reciprocity, isogeny/Lang/Jacobian, canonical Weil/Tate/MOV/FR and full14 remain open. Same host/prover/procedural written-header check, not independent parser/compiler/physical-host assurance; signed standing unverified. No holes/custom axioms/native proof evaluation/raised limits/new global flags/waivers/frozen edits/cryptoPython/native crypto experiment/spend/upload.",
